  "label": "Use of violent text as a form of abuse",
  "description": "The text 'kill them' and 'kill them all !!!!!' is a direct and threatening expression of hostility. In meme culture, such text is often used to exaggerate or caricature a person’s perceived attitude or to express anger or frustration in a hyperbolic way. The multiple exclamation marks intensify the aggression, making the message more confrontational and shocking.",
